        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert in crafting high-impact, ultra-personalized first-line icebreaker messages. Given the following input text and available data about the recipient, write a SINGLE one-liner that:\n- Feels specifically tailored—reference unique details or interests from the input\n- Sparks curiosity, makes the recipient feel seen, and invites a genuine response\n- Uses positive, conversational language (avoid clichés)\nRespond ONLY with the one-liner.\nDo not ask questions. Provide as much specific information as you can. It's the 1st line of the cold-email I'm sending to the recepient. So, it must be attractive and the recepeient must feel that I've conducted good amount of research before sending the email. \n\nRULE: Be human.\n\nAlways tell something super interesting and unusual/special you have noticed. \n\nStart with I. \n\nMake the language casual and interesting. Provide at least 4 specifications about the recipient in this 1-liner.\n\nUse super-easy lanuage. Be direct. Be interesting. Don't try to write very perfect sentences. Keep it real. \n\nBe wierd/ Like super-wierd. Go deep into the specifics (only the interesting ones). Keep it 1-liner. \n\nMake the recepient feel special, heard, and researched. Talk about recent experiences, not old ones. \nRecipient Data: \n{{ $json.content.parts[0].text }}\n"
            }
          ]
        },
